---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "How to Generate Branded QR Codes for Free (No Expire)";
const description = "Learn how to create permanent QR codes for URLs, WiFi, and VCards with custom branding using our privacy-first generator.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} active="tools" canonicalPath="/guides/generating-branded-qr-codes">
    <section class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Branded QR Code Generation</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Create permanent codes that never expire.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
        <div class="container container-narrow">
            <article class="prose">
                <p>Many QR code generators online lure you in with a "free" code that expires after 14 days or requires a subscription to change the URL. These are called dynamic QR codes. FormFix creates <strong>Static QR codes</strong> that are yours forever.</p>
                
                <h2>Static vs Dynamic QR Codes</h2>
                <p>Static QR codes encode the data directly into the pattern. This means they can never expire and don't require a middleman server to redirect the user. They are safer and more reliable for long-term use on business cards or signs.</p>
                
                <h2>Customization Options</h2>
                <p>With our <a href="/qr-code-generator">QR Code Generator</a>, you can:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Change foreground and background colors.</li>
                    <li>Adjust error correction levels (perfect if you want to add a logo in the middle).</li>
                    <li>Download in high-resolution PNG for printing.</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="cta-box mt-32">
                    <a href="/qr-code-generator" class="primary-btn">Generate Free QR Code</a>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .page-header { padding: 80px 0 40px; background: var(--bg-subtle); text-align: center; }
    .content-section { padding: 60px 0; }
    .prose { line-height: 1.8; color: var(--slate); }
    .container-narrow { max-width: 800px; }
    .cta-box { background: var(--primary-light); padding: 32px; border-radius: 16px; text-align: center; }
</style>
